; DNS for AI Discovery (DNS-AID) — SVCB/HTTPS records
; Draft: draft-mozleywilliams-dnsop-dnsaid | RFC 9460 (SVCB/HTTPS)
;
; HOW TO APPLY
; 1) These records CANNOT be published for *.vercel.app subdomains
;    (DNS for vercel.app is controlled by Vercel). To pass the DNS-AID
;    check you MUST use a custom domain (e.g. mohamedtarek.dev) with
;    Vercel + a DNS provider that supports SVCB/HTTPS (Cloudflare, etc.).
; 2) At your authoritative DNS provider, add the records below,
;    replacing the example host with your custom domain.
; 3) Enable DNSSEC at your registrar / DNS provider (required: validating
;    resolvers must return authenticated data). On Cloudflare: Dashboard
;    -> DNS -> Settings -> DNSSEC -> Enable DNSSEC. Add the provided DS
;    record at your domain registrar.
; 4) Verify via DoH (same resolvers the scanner uses):
;    node scripts/verify-dns-aid.mjs YOUR-DOMAIN.com
;    curl -H 'accept: application/dns-json' \
;      'https://cloudflare-dns.com/dns-query?name=_index._agents.YOUR-DOMAIN.com&type=HTTPS&do=1'
;
; NOTES
; - ServiceMode (priority 1) with target = your HTTPS host.
; - alpn + port are standard RFC 9460 keys; experimental DNS-AID keys
;   MUST use numeric keyNNNNN form until registered (private-use range
;   65280-65534). Here key65280 carries the agent endpoint path and
;   key65281 carries the protocol label.
; - TTL 3600 is a sane default; adjust as needed.

; ====================================================================
; 1. CLOUDFLARE DASHBOARD (Easiest: full SVCB/HTTPS + 1-Click DNSSEC)
; ====================================================================
; Go to Cloudflare Dashboard -> [Your Domain] -> DNS -> Records -> Add Record:
;
; [Record 1: Agent Index (HTTPS)]
;   Type: HTTPS
;   Name: _index._agents
;   Priority: 1
;   Target: @ (or your root domain)
;   Value / Parameters: alpn="h2" port=443 mandatory=alpn,port key65280="/.well-known/agent-card.json" key65281="index"
;   TTL: Auto
;
; [Record 2: Agent Index (SVCB)]
;   Type: SVCB
;   Name: _index._agents
;   Priority: 1
;   Target: @ (or your root domain)
;   Value / Parameters: alpn="h2" port=443 mandatory=alpn,port key65280="/.well-known/agent-card.json" key65281="index"
;   TTL: Auto
;
; [Record 3: A2A Protocol Endpoint (SVCB)]
;   Type: SVCB
;   Name: _a2a._agents
;   Priority: 1
;   Target: @
;   Value / Parameters: alpn="a2a" port=443 mandatory=alpn,port key65280="/.well-known/agent-card.json" key65281="a2a"
;   TTL: Auto
;
; [Record 4: MCP Protocol Endpoint (SVCB)]
;   Type: SVCB
;   Name: _mcp._agents
;   Priority: 1
;   Target: @
;   Value / Parameters: alpn="mcp" port=443 mandatory=alpn,port key65280="/.well-known/mcp/server-card.json" key65281="mcp"
;   TTL: Auto
;
; [Record 5: Fallback TXT Index]
;   Type: TXT
;   Name: _index._agents
;   Content: v=dnsaid1;uri=https://YOUR-DOMAIN.com/.well-known/agent-card.json;proto=a2a,mcp
;   TTL: Auto

; ====================================================================
; 2. BIND / RFC 9460 ZONE FILE FORMAT (For custom BIND or PowerDNS)
; ====================================================================
_index._agents.YOUR-DOMAIN.com. 3600 IN HTTPS 1 YOUR-DOMAIN.com. alpn="h2" port=443 mandatory=alpn,port key65280="/.well-known/agent-card.json" key65281="index"
_index._agents.YOUR-DOMAIN.com. 3600 IN SVCB  1 YOUR-DOMAIN.com. alpn="h2" port=443 mandatory=alpn,port key65280="/.well-known/agent-card.json" key65281="index"
_a2a._agents.YOUR-DOMAIN.com.   3600 IN SVCB  1 YOUR-DOMAIN.com. alpn="a2a" port=443 mandatory=alpn,port key65280="/.well-known/agent-card.json" key65281="a2a"
_mcp._agents.YOUR-DOMAIN.com.   3600 IN SVCB  1 YOUR-DOMAIN.com. alpn="mcp" port=443 mandatory=alpn,port key65280="/.well-known/mcp/server-card.json" key65281="mcp"
_index._agents.YOUR-DOMAIN.com. 3600 IN TXT   "v=dnsaid1;uri=https://YOUR-DOMAIN.com/.well-known/agent-card.json;proto=a2a,mcp"
